## Python3 코드
```python
A = [11, 8, 7, 13]
B = [2, 6, 4, 10]

result = 0

for i in range(4):
    for j in range(4):
        if A[i] + B[j] <= 16 and A[i] + B[j] > result:
            result = A[i] + B[j]

print(result)
```

## C 코드

```cpp
int A[4] = {11, 8, 13, 7}; 
int B[4] = {2, 6, 4, 10};

int result = 0;

for (int i = 0; i < 4; i++) {
    for (int j = 0; j < 4; j++) {
        if(A[i] + B[j] <= 16 && A[i] + B[j] > result) {
            result = A[i] + B[j];
        }    
    }
}
printf("%d\n", result);
```

